{"2078450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warhammer 40,000: Speed Freeks", "steam_appid": 2078450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3750860, 3824670], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/973a5c8d54779d2a71b981401cbfb4ba.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you looking for more speed and more dakka in your life? <strong>Look no further YA GITS!</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Update</strong> Speed Freeks is now coming to Playstation and Xbox! With cross platform crossplay support, so you can krump yer mates wherever they play!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/6abad11f00648cd6eac5c9f79033eb8a.poster.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/6abad11f00648cd6eac5c9f79033eb8a.webm?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/6abad11f00648cd6eac5c9f79033eb8a.mp4?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/521cda501d081d426795ee80e52643ed.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1489 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/a91e0ea9f3c4443df580f1c63662fa3b.avif?t=1781273994\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras_big/a91e0ea9f3c4443df580f1c63662fa3b.webp?t=1781273994 width=1560 height=222 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Join da Speedwaaagh! alone with bots or online with friends as you race through war-torn maps with a variety of heavily-armed, speedy and agile vehicles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove you’re the fastest git in <strong>DEFF RALLY</strong> - where teams of 8 players race and fight through waypoints, battling for position before a final sprint to the finish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/d1d9226c135379e30c8ed02060559195.poster.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/d1d9226c135379e30c8ed02060559195.webm?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/d1d9226c135379e30c8ed02060559195.mp4?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your formidable Stompa from getting bombed in <strong>KILL KONVOY</strong> - where two teams battle to slow down the opposing stompa and speed theirs up by destroying enemies. First to reach the end of the map gets the glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/609f0741e312296c6cb92c35251c3e4f.poster.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/609f0741e312296c6cb92c35251c3e4f.webm?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/609f0741e312296c6cb92c35251c3e4f.mp4?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play custom maps and racetracks from the community in<strong> KUSTOM RALLY</strong>. There's all kinds of wacky creations to choose from on the<strong> Workshop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/3a4583bfd770631b72dcd57f23983342.poster.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/3a4583bfd770631b72dcd57f23983342.webm?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/3a4583bfd770631b72dcd57f23983342.mp4?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/7541de8f7f64e358b17d415ad4849b39.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1200 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/1fe0e712d898120f9bc2b5098d351fca.avif?t=1781273994\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras_big/1fe0e712d898120f9bc2b5098d351fca.webp?t=1781273994 width=1560 height=210 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master advanced <strong>movement techniques </strong>and use<strong> explosive weaponry</strong> to dominate the racetrack<strong>!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different vehicle classes including buggies, tanks and helicopters - each with distinct abilities that target a variety of playstyles. Progress your vehicles to unlock cosmetics and alternative weapons that make enemies go boom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/a53503c95e211577f47d27e90eb3bf42.poster.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/a53503c95e211577f47d27e90eb3bf42.webm?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/a53503c95e211577f47d27e90eb3bf42.mp4?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/66fe49bec24cec48a1a4cf5c502baabe.webp?t=1781273994\" width=1200 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/1b3c73f0308d1a452d5ce4fe690b732c.poster.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/1b3c73f0308d1a452d5ce4fe690b732c.webm?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/1b3c73f0308d1a452d5ce4fe690b732c.mp4?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src