 center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/f08399ba0c69f3484ddbadb617560822.poster.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/f08399ba0c69f3484ddbadb617560822.webm?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/f08399ba0c69f3484ddbadb617560822.mp4?t=1781273994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/852b3ee49bb33e11cf95edf4ffe5705a.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1200 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/b48d10f80c1e4347acb359fb1fff6172.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1560 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Immerse yourself in the badass<strong> Warhammer 40,000 universe </strong>by joining<strong> Da Kult of Speed!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slap on different kits, rims, tires, accessories, and paint jobs for your war-torn wagons. The game’s accurate Ork vehicles are just like the miniatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/9a1ae2bf2455458bd447004a04b65776.poster.avif?t=1781273994\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078450/extras/9a1ae2bf2455458bd447004a04b65776.